<title>USA: TENNIS-FED CUP FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FED CUP FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of opening singles at the best-of-five Fed Cup final between the United States and Spain on Saturday:</p>
<p>Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Conchita Martinez (Spain) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>(U.S. leads 1-0)  </p>
<p>Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>(U.S. leads best-of-five tie 2-0)</p>
